<title>CHINA: China January-August sugar exports soar.</title>
<headline>China January-August sugar exports soar.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's 1996 sugar exports reached 462,459 tonnes in the first eight months, up 310.1 percent compared with the same year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>China exported 43,246 tonnes of sugar in August alone.</p>
<p>China's sugar imports slumped by 54.9 percent to 830,000 tonnes in the first eight months compared with the year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>China imported 70,000 tonnes of sugar in August alone.</p>
</text>
